source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\">Wyll's</a> starting camp clothing</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Despite having a unique appearance when worn, the clothes use the same icon as the the <a href=\"/wiki/Homely_Clothes\" title=\"Homely Clothes\">Homely Clothes</a>.</li>\n<li>If Wyll has equipped different clothing, he temporarily switches back to his default Camp Garb while <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mizora\" title=\"Mizora\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/25px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/38px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/50px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mizora\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/25px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mizora\" title=\"Mizora\">Mizora</a> punishes or rewards Wyll for his quest regarding <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/38px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/50px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karlach\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\">Karlach</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\" style=\"min-width:500px\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 173.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 171.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Wyll%27s_Garb_Front.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Wyll wearing his camp clothes as human\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Wyll%27s_Garb_Front.png/257px-Wyll%27s_Garb_Front.png.webp, /w/images/1/1b/Wyll%27s_Garb_Front.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Wyll wearing his camp clothes as human\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Wyll%27s_Garb_Front.png/257px-Wyll%27s_Garb_Front.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"172\" height=\"400\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Wyll%27s_Garb_Front.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Wyll wearing his camp clothes as human</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 171.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 169.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Wyll%27s_Garb_Back.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Wyll wearing his camp clothes as human\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Wyll%27s_Garb_Back.png/254px-Wyll%27s_Garb_Back.png.webp, /w/images/0/02/Wyll%27s_Garb_Back.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Wyll wearing his camp clothes as human\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Wyll%27s_Garb_Back.png/254px-Wyll%27s_Garb_Back.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"170\" height=\"400\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Wyll%27s_Garb_Back.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link